  <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">Using the generator</h2>
  <p class="mb-4">You can generate, adjust, share, and export palettes without an account. Google sign-in and the saved-palette library are currently disabled.</p>
  <p class="mb-4">Palette generation and file exports run in your browser. Shared palette links include the colors in the URL; opening a link sends that URL to the hosting server.</p>
