  <p class="mb-4">Hosting servers process request information, including IP addresses and requested URLs, to deliver the site and operate the service. Rails may set session and request-security cookies.</p>
  <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">External assets</h2>
  <p class="mb-4">Fonts load from Google Fonts, and the PDF library loads from cdnjs. Your browser contacts these providers when loading those assets.</p>
